 1269                   
 1270                   ; calculates physical sector from logical sector, IOS -> E
 1271                   ; logical sector 0..39 -> physical sector 1..5
 1272                   
 1273                   ; calculates logical track from physical track, IOT -> D
 1274                   ; 0..159 -> 0..79 (max 127)
